WEBVTT

00:08.241 --> 00:09.827
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.931 --> 00:11.689
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain.
儿童：
是的，是的，船长。

00:11.793 --> 00:13.275
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.379 --> 00:15.379
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.482 --> 00:17.586
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:17.689 --> 00:20.517
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.620 --> 00:22.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:22.586 --> 00:24.448
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.551 --> 00:26.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:26.586 --> 00:28.448
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.551 --> 00:30.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:30.172 --> 00:32.482
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.586 --> 00:34.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪Ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.586 --> 00:36.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.517 --> 00:38.586
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.689 --> 00:40.379
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.482 --> 00:44.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:44.172 --> 00:45.241
[ hearty laughter]
[爽朗的笑声]

00:45.344 --> 00:49.000
Captioning sponsored by
MTV NETWORKS
字幕赞助商
MTV 网络

01:04.103 --> 01:05.827
I surrender!
我投降！

01:05.931 --> 01:07.448
Eh?
呃？

01:07.551 --> 01:09.551
I wonder what form
of trickery
我想知道什么形式
诡计的

01:09.655 --> 01:12.586
is up that miniature
cyclops' sleeve this time.
是那个微型的
这次是独眼巨人的袖子。

01:12.689 --> 01:13.827
All right, Plankton,
好吧，浮游生物，

01:13.931 --> 01:15.862
I don't know what
you're trying to pull on me,
我不知道什么
你试图拉扯我

01:15.965 --> 01:18.034
but I'll tell you right now
it ain't gonna work!
但我现在就告诉你
这是行不通的！

01:18.137 --> 01:20.206
There's no pulling, Krabs.
没有什么可拉的，蟹蟹。

01:20.310 --> 01:22.482
Can't you see my peace offering?
你看不到我的平安祭吗？

01:22.586 --> 01:24.655
What is this?
这是什么？

01:24.758 --> 01:25.931
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

01:26.034 --> 01:27.172
Very funny, Plankton!
非常有趣，浮游生物！

01:27.275 --> 01:29.448
But you're gonna have to do
a lot better
但你必须做
好多了

01:29.551 --> 01:31.758
than taking a stab
at my illiteracy to offend me!
比刺伤
以我文盲来冒犯我！

01:31.862 --> 01:34.379
Don't you get it, Krabs?
蟹蟹你还不明白吗？

01:34.482 --> 01:35.517
I give up.
我放弃。

01:35.620 --> 01:37.310
I'm through competing with you!
我已经厌倦了和你竞争！

01:37.413 --> 01:39.413
But what about all
those fevered attempts
但全部呢
那些狂热的尝试

01:39.517 --> 01:41.724
at trying to steal my
Krabby Patty recipe?
试图偷我的
蟹肉饼的食谱？

01:41.827 --> 01:45.172
Exactly! They've all been
just attempts,
确切地！他们都曾
只是尝试，

01:45.275 --> 01:48.931
and every single one
a miserable failure!
和每一个
一次悲惨的失败！

01:49.034 --> 01:51.379
I can feel my arteries
clogging up with anxiety
我能感觉到我的动脉
因焦虑而堵塞

01:51.482 --> 01:52.586
just thinking about it.
只是想想而已。

01:52.689 --> 01:55.103
[ sighs]:
Let me show you something.
[叹气]：
让我给你看一些东西。

01:55.206 --> 01:57.137
Look at this place!
看看这个地方！

01:57.241 --> 01:58.965
Aah! Crimony, Plankton!
啊啊！克里莫尼，浮游生物！

01:59.068 --> 02:01.172
You ever hear
of spring cleaning?
你曾听过
春季大扫除？

02:01.275 --> 02:02.517
What's the point?
有什么意义？

02:02.620 --> 02:05.620
Do you know when the last time
I had a customer was?
你知道上次是什么时候吗
我有一个客户是？

02:05.724 --> 02:08.034
Actually, I can't recall
you everhaving a customer.
其实我不记得了
你曾经有一个客户。

02:08.137 --> 02:09.724
Well, there he is!
嗯，他就在那里！

02:11.068 --> 02:13.000
That's why I've decided to quit
这就是我决定退出的原因

02:13.103 --> 02:15.034
the restaurant business
altogether
餐馆生意
总共

02:15.137 --> 02:17.448
and turn the Chum Bucket into...
然后把 Chum Bucket 变成...

02:17.551 --> 02:18.793
this!
这！

02:18.896 --> 02:21.379
You want to turn
your restaurant
into a pile of junk?
你想转
你的餐厅
变成一堆垃圾？

02:21.482 --> 02:23.793
No! These are knickknacks...
不！这些都是小玩意...

02:23.896 --> 02:26.517
for the new gift shop
I'm opening up!
为新的礼品店
我要开啦！

02:26.620 --> 02:27.758
[ laughing]
[笑]

02:27.862 --> 02:30.517
Come on, this has got to be
a joke, right?
来吧，这一定是
一个笑话，对吧？

02:30.620 --> 02:32.000
I'm serious, Krabs.
我是认真的，蟹蟹。

02:32.103 --> 02:35.068
Soon the Chum Bucket will be
a nice little store
很快，密友桶就会被
一家不错的小商店

02:35.172 --> 02:36.344
for bric-a-brac and bubblegum.
用于小摆设和泡泡糖。

02:36.448 --> 02:39.034
All right, Plankton,
but be aware:
好吧，浮游生物，
但请注意：

02:39.137 --> 02:41.448
I'm not letting me guard down.
我不会让我放松警惕。

02:41.551 --> 02:43.379
Guard away, my ex-enemy.
远离我，我的前敌人。

02:43.482 --> 02:48.379
I'll just be here starting
my new competition-free career.
我就从这里开始
我新的无竞争职业。

02:48.482 --> 02:49.931
[ singing happily]
[快乐地唱歌]

02:50.034 --> 02:51.689
[ muttering]
[嘀咕]

02:51.793 --> 02:53.724
What's going on,
Mr. Krabs?
发生了什么事，
蟹老板？

02:53.827 --> 02:56.379
Plankton's concocted
another hair-brained scheme
浮游生物炮制的
另一个费脑筋的计划

02:56.482 --> 02:59.068
to steal me recipe--
so keep your eyes peeled.
偷我的食谱——
所以请擦亮眼睛。

02:59.172 --> 03:01.068
Whatever you say, Cap'n!
不管你说什么，船长！

03:02.551 --> 03:05.103
Now, that's an employee
who follows orders.
现在，那是一名员工
谁听从命令。

03:05.206 --> 03:06.206
[ rumbling]
[隆隆声]

03:06.310 --> 03:09.068
What in blazes is that noise?
火焰中的噪音是什么？

03:11.793 --> 03:14.724
Ah, would you look at that!
啊，你会看那个吗！

03:14.827 --> 03:19.206
I have a feeling I'm gonna like
this new life of novelty items.
我有一种感觉我会喜欢
这种新奇物品的新生活。

03:19.310 --> 03:22.103
Uh-huh! Clever, Plankton!
嗯嗯！聪明啊，浮游生物！

03:22.206 --> 03:24.103
Two can play at this game!
这个游戏可以两个人玩！

03:24.206 --> 03:25.379
Mr. Krabs,
蟹老板先生，

03:25.482 --> 03:28.965
look at this cool knickknack
I got at the Chumporium!
看看这个很酷的小玩意
我到了Chumporium！

03:29.068 --> 03:32.379
Hmm. I know there's a microphone
or camera in here somewhere.
唔。我知道有麦克风
或相机在这里的某个地方。

03:32.482 --> 03:34.517
[ grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:34.620 --> 03:36.517
Uh, Mr. Krabs,
I really don't think
呃，蟹老板先生，
我真的不认为

03:36.620 --> 03:37.793
there's anything weird in there.
里面有什么奇怪的东西。

03:37.896 --> 03:41.448
Eh, we'll see about that.
嗯，我们会看看的。

03:42.724 --> 03:45.068
I'll just put this in here
for safekeeping.
我就把它放在这里
以便妥善保管。

03:45.172 --> 03:46.413
You hear, Plankton?
你听到了吗，浮游生物？

03:46.517 --> 03:49.344
Join your other friend
from the past!
加入你的另一个朋友
来自过去！

03:52.172 --> 03:54.310
Now nobody's getting
to see anything!
现在没人得到
看到任何东西！

03:54.413 --> 03:55.551
Don't you understand?
你不明白吗？

03:55.655 --> 03:58.103
This is all part of his ruse--
it's just cosmetic.
这都是他诡计的一部分——
这只是装饰性的。

03:58.206 --> 04:00.000
He thinks
he can fake us out.
他认为
他可以欺骗我们。

04:00.103 --> 04:01.413
But we'll show him.
但我们会告诉他。

04:01.517 --> 04:03.655
We're gonna out-fake
the faker! Ha-ha!
我们要假装
骗子！哈哈！

04:03.758 --> 04:06.689
[ loudly]:
Well, it looks like
old Plankton's
[大声]：
嗯，看起来像
老浮游生物

04:06.793 --> 04:08.586
really going through with it.
真的正在经历它。

04:08.689 --> 04:12.896
I guess we don't have to worry
about himanymore.
我想我们不必担心
关于他不再有。

04:13.000 --> 04:16.827
Yep, we sure whipped him
this time.
是的，我们确实鞭打了他
这次。

04:16.931 --> 04:20.413
Okay, boys, the coast is clear!
好吧，孩子们，海岸已经畅通无阻了！

04:20.517 --> 04:23.413
Plankton's turned over
a new leaf!
浮游生物翻身了
新叶！

04:23.517 --> 04:25.620
That's some good
news, Mr. Krabs!
这有一些好
蟹老板，有消息了！

04:25.724 --> 04:27.103
It sure is, you little half-wit.
确实如此，你这个小傻瓜。

04:27.206 --> 04:29.310
And you know what else
is good news?
你知道还有什么吗
是好消息吗？

04:29.413 --> 04:32.241
We can finally use
that deejay system.
我们终于可以使用
那个DJ系统。

04:32.344 --> 04:33.517
Hit it, SpongeBob!
打吧，海绵宝宝！

04:33.620 --> 04:34.793
Right away, sir!
马上，先生！

04:34.896 --> 04:37.275
Let's party!
让我们一起狂欢吧！

04:37.379 --> 04:38.758
[ percussive dance music plays]
[打击乐舞曲响起]

04:38.862 --> 04:40.172
[ needle scratching
rhythmically]
[ 针刮伤
有节奏地]

04:40.275 --> 04:41.586
[ dance music playing]
[舞曲演奏]

04:41.689 --> 04:43.344
Ow! I won!
噢！我赢了！

04:43.448 --> 04:45.310
It's time to boogie!
是时候布吉了！

04:45.413 --> 04:48.620
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
是的！是的！是的！是的！是的！

04:48.724 --> 04:50.413
This is idiotic.
这太愚蠢了。

04:50.517 --> 04:52.034
Dance or you're fired.
跳舞，否则你就会被解雇。

04:52.137 --> 04:55.000
You got it, Mr. Krabs.
你明白了，蟹老板。

04:55.103 --> 04:56.241
[ rumbling]
[隆隆声]

04:56.344 --> 04:58.310
How do you like themapples,
you little...
你喜欢苹果吗？
你这个小...

04:58.413 --> 04:59.793
[ record needle scratches,
music stops]
[记录针划痕，
音乐停止]

04:59.896 --> 05:02.068
[ humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

05:02.172 --> 05:04.793
Come on, buddy,
let's get some shut-eye.
来吧，伙计，
让我们闭目养神吧。

05:04.896 --> 05:08.551
We've got a big day ahead of us
at the Chumporium Gift Shop.
我们即将迎来重要的一天
在 Chumporium 礼品店。

05:08.655 --> 05:10.344
Wait a minute!
等一下！

05:12.517 --> 05:13.517
What the...?
什么……？

05:13.620 --> 05:15.172
Store shelves?
商店货架？

05:15.275 --> 05:16.827
Novelty toys?
新奇玩具？

05:16.931 --> 05:18.482
Lava lamps?!
熔岩灯？！

05:18.586 --> 05:19.724
[ squeaky gasp]
[吱吱的喘息声]

05:19.827 --> 05:21.620
Useless knickknacks?!
没用的小玩意？！

05:21.724 --> 05:23.655
Very convincin'...
非常有说服力...

05:23.758 --> 05:25.172
but I'm still not buying it!
但我还是不买！

05:25.275 --> 05:27.034
You want a battle, Plankton?
你想要一场战斗吗，浮游生物？

05:27.137 --> 05:29.482
I'm gonna give you a war!
我要给你一场战争！

05:29.586 --> 05:31.931
[ Plankton singing happily]
[浮游生物欢快地歌唱]

05:32.034 --> 05:34.655
[ singing, laughing]
[唱歌，笑]

05:34.758 --> 05:39.241
Ah, a clean snow globe
is a happy snow globe.
啊，一个干净的雪球
是一个快乐的雪球。

05:39.344 --> 05:40.551
[ chuckles]
[笑声]

05:40.655 --> 05:41.655
Plankton!
浮游生物！

05:41.758 --> 05:43.344
You may have fooled
everyone else,
你可能被骗了
其他人，

05:43.448 --> 05:45.103
you might have even
fooled yourself,
你甚至可能有
欺骗自己，

05:45.206 --> 05:47.034
but you ain't foolin' me!
但你没骗我！

05:47.137 --> 05:48.586
Oh. [ chuckles]
哦。 [笑声]

05:48.689 --> 05:51.379
I get it--
you caught me red-handed.
我明白了——
你当场抓住了我。

05:51.482 --> 05:52.862
[ chuckles]
[笑声]

05:52.965 --> 05:54.620
[ long sigh]
[长叹]

05:54.724 --> 05:57.137
Those were the days,
huh, Eugene?
那些日子，
嗯，尤金？

05:57.241 --> 05:58.862
[ angry grunting]
[愤怒的咕哝]

05:58.965 --> 06:01.413
But I found
there was more to life
但我发现
生活还有更多

06:01.517 --> 06:03.586
than just trying to steal
your formula.
而不仅仅是试图偷窃
你的公式。

06:03.689 --> 06:07.482
I found it all right here,
in novelty items.
我在这里找到了一切
在新奇的物品中。

06:07.586 --> 06:08.241
Bupkes!
布克斯！

06:08.344 --> 06:09.517
Oh, Eugene...
哦，尤金...

06:09.620 --> 06:11.344
stuck in your old ways.
坚持你的旧方式。

06:11.448 --> 06:14.689
Bupkes! If there's one thing
that is certain in this world,
布克斯！如果有一件事
这在这个世界上是确定的

06:14.793 --> 06:17.551
it's that you can't resist
me formula!
这是你无法抗拒的
我的公式！

06:17.655 --> 06:19.034
You know
你知道

06:19.137 --> 06:20.517
you want it.
你想要它。

06:20.620 --> 06:22.448
Thanks... but no.
谢谢...但是没有。

06:22.551 --> 06:23.655
Uh-huh! Uh-huh! I knew it!
嗯嗯！嗯嗯！我就知道！

06:23.758 --> 06:26.655
It was all a trick to get me
to hand over me...
这都是骗我的
把我交给...

06:26.758 --> 06:28.724
Wait. Did you say... no?
等待。你说……不？

06:28.827 --> 06:32.482
Well, if you don't believe me,
that's yourproblem, not mine.
好吧，如果你不相信我，
那是你的问题，不是我的。

06:32.586 --> 06:34.448
Problem?!
I don't have a problem!
问题？！
我没有问题！

06:34.551 --> 06:36.310
You're the one with the problem!
你就是有问题的人！

06:36.413 --> 06:37.379
Look at this.
看看这个。

06:37.482 --> 06:38.724
It means nothing!
没什么意义！

06:38.827 --> 06:40.620
It's all a facade! A hoax!
这都是门面！骗局！

06:40.724 --> 06:42.482
A con! A front!
一个骗局！正面！

06:42.586 --> 06:43.517
[ gasps]
[喘气]

06:43.620 --> 06:45.862
A sham! A snow job!
一个骗局！雪地作业！

06:46.758 --> 06:48.758
Baloney with a side of flimflam
胡言乱语，一面胡言乱语

06:48.862 --> 06:50.448
and an order of jive!
还有一份 jive 的订单！

06:50.551 --> 06:53.482
See? Who's the one
with the problem?!
看？谁是那个人
有问题吗？

06:53.586 --> 06:56.310
[ crying]:
Look... what you've done.
[哭泣]：
看看……你做了什么。

06:56.413 --> 06:58.827
This is my livelihood!
这就是我的生计！

06:58.931 --> 07:00.862
Sureit is!
当然是！

07:00.965 --> 07:05.482
And this isn'tthe formula
that you don'twant.
这不是公式
你不想要的。

07:05.586 --> 07:07.827
Come on, eh? Eh?
来吧，嗯？呃？

07:07.931 --> 07:09.310
Woop. Too slow.
哇。太慢了。

07:09.413 --> 07:10.655
Ah, ga-ga-
ga-ga-ga.
啊，嘎嘎——
嘎嘎嘎。

07:10.758 --> 07:14.172
[ booming]:
Get... out!
[蓬勃发展]：
滚出去！

07:14.275 --> 07:15.275
Huh?
啊？

07:15.379 --> 07:17.413
Oh. I get it.
哦。我得到它。

07:17.517 --> 07:20.241
Stick to your guns and
eventually we'll all believe it.
坚持你的枪并
最终我们都会相信。

07:20.344 --> 07:23.448
Soften us up,
then when our backs are turned,
软化我们，
然后当我们转过身去时，

07:23.551 --> 07:26.137
you make your move.
你行动吧。

07:26.241 --> 07:28.620
Oops.
哎呀。

07:28.724 --> 07:30.034
What's this?
这是什么？

07:31.379 --> 07:32.758
[ groans]
[呻吟]

07:32.862 --> 07:33.931
PLANKTON:
Hey, Krabs!
浮游生物：
嘿，蟹蟹们！

07:34.034 --> 07:36.068
Huh? What?
I knew you'd come back.
啊？什么？
我就知道你会回来的。

07:36.172 --> 07:38.448
You forgot
something.
你忘了
某事。

07:38.551 --> 07:41.586
Can't you understand,
I've wasted so much time
你难道不明白吗，
我已经浪费了太多时间

07:41.689 --> 07:46.137
chasing after you, and now
I have something that's mine.
追你，现在
我有一些属于我的东西。

07:46.241 --> 07:49.758
And it makes me... happy.
这让我……很高兴。

07:50.931 --> 07:53.517
I never thought I'd see the day.
我从没想过我会看到这一天。

07:53.620 --> 07:56.655
What happened to
the invertebrate I usedto know?
发生了什么事
我以前认识的无脊椎动物？

07:56.758 --> 07:58.172
Plankton!
浮游生物！

07:58.275 --> 08:01.586
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:01.689 --> 08:04.758
[ continues sobbing]
[继续抽泣]

08:08.931 --> 08:11.448
[ phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

08:11.551 --> 08:13.758
[ continues ringing][ knobs squeaking]
[继续响铃][旋钮吱吱作响]

08:13.862 --> 08:15.517
Coming, coming.
来了，来了。

08:15.620 --> 08:16.517
Whew!
哇！

08:16.620 --> 08:17.551
Yo.
哟。

08:17.655 --> 08:19.827
Uh, Plankton?Eugene?
呃，浮游生物？尤金？

08:19.931 --> 08:22.172
Uh... hey.
呃...嘿。

08:22.275 --> 08:23.241
Hey.
嘿。

08:23.344 --> 08:26.689
Listen, uh,
I just wanted to...
听着，呃，
我只是想...

08:26.793 --> 08:31.241
you know... apologize
for my behavior today.
你知道...道歉
对于我今天的行为。

08:31.344 --> 08:33.103
Wasn't right what I done, and...
我所做的不对，而且...

08:33.206 --> 08:35.655
and I realized I hurt
the feelings of, uh...
我意识到我受伤了
的感受，呃...

08:35.758 --> 08:37.068
[ clears throat,
coughs nervously]
[清清喉咙，
紧张地咳嗽]

08:37.172 --> 08:40.379
...of, uh, someone I care about.
...呃，我关心的人。

08:41.758 --> 08:43.137
You still there?
你还在吗？

08:43.241 --> 08:44.379
Yeah.
是的。

08:44.482 --> 08:45.827
I'm still here.
我还在这里。

08:45.931 --> 08:47.448
[ chuckles]:
Good.
[轻笑]：
很好。

08:47.551 --> 08:48.862
Uh...
呃...

08:48.965 --> 08:51.241
I want to make it up to you.
我想补偿你。

08:51.344 --> 08:53.551
What do you say we grab a soda?
你说我们喝杯苏打水怎么样？

08:53.655 --> 08:54.931
Sure.
当然。

08:58.931 --> 09:00.586
Glad you could
make it, buddy.
很高兴你能
做到吧，伙计。

09:00.689 --> 09:04.413
So... what's this about, Krabs?
那么...这是怎么回事，蟹蟹？

09:04.517 --> 09:07.241
I thought that since we're
no longer archenemies,
我想既然我们
不再是宿敌

09:07.344 --> 09:08.724
maybe...
或许...

09:08.827 --> 09:11.517
maybe we can...
start over?
也许我们可以...
重新开始？

09:12.758 --> 09:14.310
Yes.
是的。

09:14.413 --> 09:17.448
Yes, I would like that
very much.
是的，我愿意
非常喜欢。

09:23.689 --> 09:25.551
I guess I won.
我想我赢了。

09:25.655 --> 09:28.862
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:45.896 --> 09:48.965
Uh, I don't know about this,
Plankton.
呃，我不知道这个，
浮游生物。

09:49.068 --> 09:51.551
Oh, come on, just fall back.
噢，来吧，退后吧。

09:51.655 --> 09:53.827
Trust me, I'll catch you.
[ chuckles]
相信我，我会抓住你的。
[笑声]

09:53.931 --> 09:55.413
[ creaking]
[吱吱作响]

09:55.517 --> 09:57.379
[ whistling through air]
[空气中呼啸]

10:00.206 --> 10:01.862
[ grunting with effort]
[用力咕哝]

10:01.965 --> 10:04.379
[ grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:04.482 --> 10:06.241
[ gasping breaths]
[喘气]

10:08.827 --> 10:12.206
That was truly amazing,
Plank, old buddy.
那真是太神奇了，
普朗克，老伙计。

10:12.310 --> 10:15.862
I guess I really can
trust you 100%.
我想我真的可以
100%相信你。

10:15.965 --> 10:17.379
Thanks, Eugene.
谢谢，尤金。

10:17.482 --> 10:19.517
That... means a lot to me.
这……对我来说意义重大。

10:19.620 --> 10:21.206
And just to prove it to you,
只是为了向你证明，

10:21.310 --> 10:23.034
I want you
to have something.
我想要你
拥有一些东西。

10:23.137 --> 10:25.517
No, no, come on,
now, no gifts.
不不不，来吧，
现在，没有礼物了。

10:25.620 --> 10:28.172
No, no. I want you
to have this.
不，不。我想要你
拥有这个。

10:28.275 --> 10:29.724
It's me secret formula.
这是我的秘密配方。

10:29.827 --> 10:32.862
I can't believe
you would even think...
我不敢相信
你甚至会想...

10:32.965 --> 10:34.482
But things are different now.
但现在情况不同了。

10:34.586 --> 10:37.517
Honestly,
it would mean a lot to me.
老实说，
这对我来说意义重大。

10:37.620 --> 10:41.172
You... you're serious.
你……你是认真的。

10:41.931 --> 10:43.482
[ sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

10:43.586 --> 10:48.482
Eugene, if I take this formula
from you now,
尤金，如果我采用这个公式
从你现在开始，

10:48.586 --> 10:52.000
there will always be
a hint of doubt.
总会有
一丝疑惑。

10:52.103 --> 10:54.379
Come on, take it.
来吧，拿走吧。

10:56.482 --> 10:58.896
You sure?
你确定吗？

11:02.034 --> 11:03.586
[ sighs]
[叹气]

11:03.689 --> 11:05.413
Life is good, Krabs.
生活是美好的，蟹蟹。

11:05.517 --> 11:07.034
Sure is, buddy.
当然是，伙计。

11:07.137 --> 11:09.448
Sure is.
当然是。

11:10.655 --> 11:12.896
Yeah, baby!
是的，宝贝！

11:13.000 --> 11:14.206
This is it!
就是这样！

11:14.310 --> 11:15.586
Yeah!
是的！

11:15.689 --> 11:18.517
Whoo! Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼！呼呼呼！

11:18.620 --> 11:20.068
[ laughing loudly]
[大声笑]

11:20.172 --> 11:21.137
Yeah!
是的！

11:21.241 --> 11:23.206
I got it! I got it!
我得到了它！我得到了它！

11:23.310 --> 11:27.896
My diabolical, extremely
convoluted plan worked!
我的恶魔，极其
复杂的计划奏效了！

11:28.000 --> 11:30.068
I should have been a politician.
我本应该成为一名政治家。

11:30.172 --> 11:32.517
[ laughing]
[笑]

11:34.172 --> 11:36.620
I'd never give
you the formula!
我永远不会给
你这个公式！

11:36.724 --> 11:38.172
[ Krabs laughing]
[螃蟹笑]

11:38.275 --> 11:42.275
I fooled you with an even more
convoluted charade!
我还用一个更愚弄你的方法
错综复杂的谜语！

11:42.379 --> 11:44.551
[ laughing]
[笑]

11:46.137 --> 11:49.344
[ Plankton yelling]
[浮游生物的叫喊]

12:03.206 --> 12:07.689
[ chirping]
[叽叽喳喳]

12:07.793 --> 12:10.344
What a sun-tastic day!
多么阳光明媚的一天啊！

12:10.448 --> 12:11.379
Whoa!
哇！

12:11.482 --> 12:15.275
Snail trail.
蜗牛踪迹。

12:16.724 --> 12:19.931
That SpongeBob needs to keep
his pet out of my yard.
海绵宝宝需要保留
他的宠物离开我的院子。

12:21.000 --> 12:23.206
I am sick of cleaning up
after him.
我厌倦了清理工作
在他之后。

12:23.310 --> 12:26.103
[ muttering]
[嘀咕]

12:29.241 --> 12:32.413
Not my pet rock collection.
不是我的宠物摇滚收藏。

12:32.517 --> 12:34.137
[ blubbering]
[哭泣]

12:34.241 --> 12:37.793
That's it!
就是这样！

12:37.896 --> 12:41.172
This isn't the first time
you've soiled my yard
这不是第一次
你弄脏了我的院子

12:41.275 --> 12:43.275
with your revolting
excretions.
与你的反叛
排泄物。

12:43.379 --> 12:46.172
But mark this down
in your little notebook.
但记下这一点
在你的小笔记本里。

12:46.275 --> 12:51.448
It will be the last time!
这将是最后一次！

12:55.689 --> 12:58.103
Ow!
噢！

13:01.137 --> 13:05.517
This cheap splintery wood
will keep even Gary out.
这种廉价的碎木头
甚至连加里也会被排除在外。

13:08.000 --> 13:10.241
Now I feel safe.
现在我感到安全了。

13:10.344 --> 13:13.068
[ squishing]
[压扁]

13:16.172 --> 13:17.586
Huh?
啊？

13:17.689 --> 13:21.275
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

13:21.379 --> 13:22.448
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

13:22.551 --> 13:23.896
[ calm voice]:
Hey, SpongeBob.
[平静的声音]：
嘿，海绵宝宝。

13:24.000 --> 13:28.034
[ yelling]:
Keep your shell vermin
off of my property!
[大喊]：
保留你的外壳害虫
离开我的财产！

13:28.137 --> 13:30.965
Then next time, my annoyingly
yellow neighbor,
那么下一次，我烦人
黄色邻居，

13:31.068 --> 13:33.586
your wet pet oozes
on my lawn,
你的宠物湿透了
在我的草坪上，

13:33.689 --> 13:35.620
you'll leave me
no choice
你会离开我
别无选择

13:35.724 --> 13:37.827
but to call snail control.
但要打电话给蜗牛控制。

13:37.931 --> 13:39.931
That little monster...
那个小怪物...

13:40.034 --> 13:43.310
[ sputtering][ growling]
[溅射][咆哮]

13:43.413 --> 13:44.896
He bit me!
他咬了我！

13:45.000 --> 13:46.482
Gary!
加里！

13:46.586 --> 13:48.310
No, dirty boy.
不，肮脏的孩子。

13:48.413 --> 13:49.413
This isn't like you.
这不像你。

13:49.517 --> 13:52.551
Oh, but it's just
like you, SpongeBob,
哦，但这只是
就像你一样，海绵宝宝，

13:52.655 --> 13:54.793
to raise such
a misbehaved mollusk.
提出这样的
行为不端的软体动物

13:54.896 --> 13:56.724
Gary's not
misbehaved.
加里不是
行为不端。

13:56.827 --> 13:59.620
[ snarling]
[咆哮]

13:59.724 --> 14:01.793
But there does appear
to be something wrong with him.
但确实出现了
他有什么问题。

14:01.896 --> 14:04.724
I'll say.
I hope he's
had his shots.
我会说。
我希望他是
有他的镜头。

14:04.827 --> 14:06.310
Oh, of course.
哦，当然。

14:06.413 --> 14:07.379
All of his shots?
他的所有镜头？

14:07.482 --> 14:08.310
Affirmatory.
肯定的。

14:08.413 --> 14:09.413
For rabies?Yep.
狂犬病？是的。

14:09.517 --> 14:12.379
Snail pox and soft shell dance?Yupie.
蜗牛痘和软壳舞？Yupie。

14:12.482 --> 14:15.689
Bagitis, lumpy-bump trump,
teen angst?Yep, yep, yep.
巴炎、特朗普的肿块、
青少年焦虑？是的，是的，是的。

14:15.793 --> 14:18.551
Let's not forget
the worst of them all.
我们不要忘记
其中最糟糕的。

14:18.655 --> 14:20.965
Mad snail disease.
疯狂蜗牛病。

14:21.068 --> 14:22.103
Uh...
呃...

14:22.206 --> 14:24.586
You mean your pet
hasn't been vaccinated
你是说你的宠物
尚未接种疫苗

14:24.689 --> 14:26.827
for mad snail disease?
疯狂蜗牛病？

14:26.931 --> 14:29.758
Looks like the rash
has already started.
看起来像皮疹
已经开始了。

14:29.862 --> 14:31.241
Rash?
皮疹？

14:31.344 --> 14:34.379
Tell me, do you have
any soreness of throat?
告诉我，你有吗
有喉咙痛吗？

14:34.482 --> 14:36.172
[ gulps]
[咽口水]

14:36.275 --> 14:37.551
Well, now that you
mention it
好吧，现在你
提到它

14:37.655 --> 14:38.931
my throat is
a little dry.
我的喉咙是
有点干。

14:39.034 --> 14:42.241
This disease will ravage
your body
这种病会肆虐
你的身体

14:42.344 --> 14:46.206
with bloodshot eyes,
loss of balance,
Whoa.
眼睛布满血丝，
失去平衡，
哇哦。

14:46.310 --> 14:47.551
messy pants,
凌乱的裤子，

14:47.655 --> 14:49.931
ticklish rib cage,[ laughing]
肋骨发痒，[笑]

14:50.034 --> 14:52.172
severely untrimmed
toenails
严重未经修剪
脚趾甲

14:52.275 --> 14:55.448
and finally, the bite
from that infected snail
最后，咬一口
来自那只受感染的蜗牛

14:55.551 --> 14:58.758
will turn you
into...
会让你转变
进入...

14:58.862 --> 14:59.689
A zombie.
一个僵尸。

14:59.793 --> 15:03.000
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

15:03.103 --> 15:06.000
You need to get that snail
of yours to a doctor
你需要得到那只蜗牛
你给医生的

15:06.103 --> 15:08.517
before he bites
someone important.
在他咬之前
某个重要的人。

15:08.620 --> 15:09.896
[ both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

15:10.000 --> 15:11.758
There's a mad snail
on the loose!
有一只疯狂的蜗牛
逍遥法外！

15:11.862 --> 15:13.275
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

15:13.379 --> 15:15.241
Gary? Gary? Gary? Gary?!
加里？加里？加里？加里？！

15:15.344 --> 15:17.448
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

15:17.551 --> 15:19.172
The mad snail is coming!
疯狂的蜗牛来了！

15:19.275 --> 15:22.827
If he bites you,
you'll turn into
a zombie.
如果他咬你的话
你会变成
僵尸。

15:22.931 --> 15:25.517
Jeepers, what's with
all the lunatics?
吉普车，有什么
所有的疯子？

15:27.172 --> 15:29.620
Oh, look, honey,
isn't he the cutest?
哦，看，亲爱的，
他不是最可爱的吗？

15:29.724 --> 15:32.137
[ panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:32.241 --> 15:33.896
Come here,
little buddy.
来这里，
小伙伴。

15:34.000 --> 15:38.068
He's just adorable.
他很可爱。

15:39.241 --> 15:41.275
Mad snail disease is real!
疯狂蜗牛病是真的！

15:41.379 --> 15:44.551
I'm a zombie.
I've been bitten
by a mad snail.
我是僵尸。
我被咬了
由一只疯狂的蜗牛。

15:44.655 --> 15:46.448
I've got mad
snail disease!
我生气了
蜗牛病！

15:46.551 --> 15:49.310
Then I've got it!
A snail just bit me, too!
那我就明白了！
我也被蜗牛咬了！

15:49.413 --> 15:51.827
[ both screaming]
[两人都尖叫]

15:51.931 --> 15:54.551
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

15:58.241 --> 15:59.931
[ all screaming]
[全都尖叫]

16:02.068 --> 16:04.862
We interrupt this program
to bring you a news blast.
我们中断这个程序
为您带来爆炸性新闻。

16:07.793 --> 16:09.448
This just in...
这只是在...

16:09.551 --> 16:11.275
Fear and disease is spreading
like wildfire
恐惧和疾病正在蔓延
像野火一样

16:11.379 --> 16:13.862
as a killer snail has been
biting the denizens
就像杀手蜗牛一样
咬住居民

16:13.965 --> 16:15.137
of Bikini Bottom.
的比基尼底部。

16:15.241 --> 16:18.896
Infecting them with...
感染他们...

16:19.000 --> 16:21.379
Ask any old fish on the street
and they'll tell you
问问街上有没有老鱼
他们会告诉你

16:21.482 --> 16:23.310
that germs enter through
the bite radius.
细菌可以通过
咬合半径。

16:23.413 --> 16:25.310
Traveling upstream until
the entire host body
逆流而上直至
整个宿主身体

16:25.413 --> 16:29.310
is full of...
充满了...

16:29.413 --> 16:32.034
We now take you to Action News
Reporter Perch Perkins
现在我们带您进入行动新闻
记者珀奇帕金斯

16:32.137 --> 16:33.655
live on the scene.
现场直播。

16:33.758 --> 16:35.620
Perch Perkins here with
with the first victim
鲈鱼帕金斯在这里
与第一个受害者

16:35.724 --> 16:36.931
of this epidemic.
这次疫情。

16:37.034 --> 16:38.931
Tell me, Mr. Tentacles,
when did you first
告诉我，触手先生，
你第一次是什么时候

16:39.034 --> 16:41.689
begin to suspect
you were a zombie?
开始怀疑
你是僵尸吗？

16:41.793 --> 16:44.620
Well, after I was bitten
by a mad snail
嗯，被咬后
由一只疯狂的蜗牛

16:44.724 --> 16:46.379
I began to get a rash.
我开始出现皮疹。

16:46.482 --> 16:49.344
Followed by loss of balance,
ticklish rib cage
随后失去平衡，
怕痒的肋骨

16:49.448 --> 16:51.206
and a few other symptoms.
以及其他一些症状。

16:51.310 --> 16:53.275
Hey, I was bitten
by a snail.
嘿嘿，我被咬了
由一只蜗牛。

16:53.379 --> 16:55.275
I kind of feel
off balance.
我有点感觉
失去平衡。

16:55.379 --> 16:56.931
Whoa.
哇哦。

16:57.034 --> 16:59.103
Hey, I have ticklish
ribs, too.
嘿嘿，我怕痒
排骨也是。

16:59.206 --> 17:00.620
And I haven't even
been bitten.
而我什至还没有
被咬了。

17:00.724 --> 17:02.931
Oh, no, it's spreading
through the air!
哦不，正在蔓延
通过空气！

17:03.034 --> 17:05.034
[ all screaming]
[全都尖叫]

17:05.137 --> 17:06.551
Well, you heard it
here first.
嗯，你听到了
首先在这里。

17:06.655 --> 17:08.793
We're all doomed
to a horrible demise,
我们都注定了
走向可怕的死亡，

17:08.896 --> 17:10.344
thanks to a diseased snail.
感谢一只生病的蜗牛。

17:10.448 --> 17:12.103
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:13.517 --> 17:15.413
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:16.172 --> 17:19.137
[ all screaming]
[全都尖叫]

17:19.241 --> 17:21.034
Gary?
加里？

17:21.137 --> 17:23.482
[ horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

17:23.586 --> 17:26.517
I can't believe that sweet
and slimy snail
我简直不敢相信这么甜
和粘糊糊的蜗牛

17:26.620 --> 17:29.000
would cause all this
destruction.
会导致这一切
破坏。

17:29.103 --> 17:30.586
[ Squidward moaning]
[章鱼哥的呻吟声]

17:30.689 --> 17:33.344
I'm a zombie,
我是僵尸，

17:33.448 --> 17:37.034
here to dine on your
squishy yellow flesh.
在这里吃饭
软软的黄色果肉。

17:37.137 --> 17:38.827
[ moaning]
[呻吟]

17:38.931 --> 17:40.275
[ gasps]
[喘气]

17:40.379 --> 17:43.344
[ all moaning]
[全都呻吟]

17:49.034 --> 17:51.034
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

17:57.758 --> 17:59.206
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

18:05.620 --> 18:06.620
It's locked!
它被锁了！

18:06.724 --> 18:08.517
[ moaning]
[呻吟]

18:10.413 --> 18:12.103
Somebody let me in.
有人让我进去。

18:12.206 --> 18:13.620
SpongeBob, come in, boy.
海绵宝宝，进来吧，男孩。

18:13.724 --> 18:14.793
And bring your friends
in, too.
并带上你的朋友
也在。

18:14.896 --> 18:16.206
They look
hungry.
他们看起来
饿了。

18:18.137 --> 18:19.655
Stop! You can't
let anyone in!
停止！你不能
让任何人进来！

18:19.758 --> 18:21.965
But they just want to dine
on some krabby patties.
但他们只是想吃饭
放在一些蟹肉饼上。

18:22.068 --> 18:23.482
They're zombies.
他们是僵尸。

18:23.586 --> 18:25.551
They only want to dine
on our flesh.
他们只想吃饭
在我们的肉体上。

18:25.655 --> 18:29.034
All right, but it's coming
out of your paycheck.
好吧，但它即将到来
从你的薪水中扣除。

18:29.137 --> 18:30.068
I don't work here.
我不在这里工作。

18:30.172 --> 18:32.551
But, Mr. Krabs,
it's me SpongeBob.
但是，蟹老板，
我是海绵宝宝。

18:32.655 --> 18:34.482
But how do we know
you haven't become
但我们怎么知道
你还没有成为

18:34.586 --> 18:36.172
one of those voracious
flesh-eaters?
那些贪婪的人之一
食肉者？

18:36.275 --> 18:38.758
Could a voracious
flesh-eater do this?
能否贪婪
肉食者会这样做吗？

18:40.551 --> 18:42.172
SpongeBob, it's you.
海绵宝宝，是你。

18:42.275 --> 18:44.965
That's right,
so let me in
before I'm eaten.
没错，
所以让我进去
在我被吃之前。

18:45.068 --> 18:48.172
Yeah, that's SpongeBob
all right.
是的，这就是海绵宝宝
好吧。

18:48.275 --> 18:50.034
Or is it?Huh?
或者说是吗？嗯？

18:50.137 --> 18:53.724
I don't believe that's
the real SpongeBob.
我不相信那是
真正的海绵宝宝。

18:53.827 --> 18:56.620
He looks pretty
zombie-fied.
他看起来很漂亮
僵尸领域。

18:56.724 --> 18:58.620
Just look at how
yellow he is.
看看如何
他是黄色的。

18:58.724 --> 19:01.482
Come on, Patrick, would a zombie
have a picture of his best buddy
来吧，帕特里克，会是僵尸吗
有他最好的朋友的照片

19:01.586 --> 19:03.000
in his wallet?
在他的钱包里？

19:04.689 --> 19:06.000
Perhaps not.
也许不是。

19:06.103 --> 19:07.689
But I've got
my eye on you.
但我有
我的目光落在你身上。

19:07.793 --> 19:10.827
If you could pull out your eye
and put it on him,
如果你能把你的眼睛挖出来
并给他戴上，

19:10.931 --> 19:12.827
wouldn't that make you
那不会让你

19:12.931 --> 19:14.655
a zombie, too?
也是僵尸？

19:14.758 --> 19:16.241
[ all gasping]
[全都喘气]

19:17.448 --> 19:18.620
You're right.
你说得对。

19:18.724 --> 19:20.172
I'm a zombie!
我是僵尸！

19:20.275 --> 19:23.068
Who's to say we're not
all zombies?
谁说我们不是
所有僵尸？

19:23.172 --> 19:24.586
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

19:31.827 --> 19:33.103
[ all gasping]
[全都喘气]

19:33.206 --> 19:35.000
ALL:
The snail!
全部：
蜗牛！

19:35.103 --> 19:36.103
Gary!
加里！

19:36.206 --> 19:37.551
Are you okay, buddy?
你还好吗，伙计？

19:37.655 --> 19:39.137
Come here, boy.
来这里，男孩。

19:39.241 --> 19:40.931
No, don't get near it.
不，不要靠近它。

19:41.034 --> 19:42.344
Oh, the pity of it all.
哦，这一切真是可惜。

19:42.448 --> 19:43.586
I can't watch.
我看不下去了

19:43.689 --> 19:46.275
All those people think
you're a monster,
所有这些人都认为
你是一个怪物，

19:46.379 --> 19:48.172
but I know you're
just a snail.
但我知道你是
只是一只蜗牛。

19:48.275 --> 19:51.103
[ barking]
[吠叫]

19:52.310 --> 19:53.241
[ all gasping]
[全都喘气]

19:53.344 --> 19:54.586
[ belches]
[打嗝]

19:56.517 --> 19:57.413
Gary...
加里...

19:57.517 --> 19:58.896
[ sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

19:59.000 --> 20:00.172
...how could you?
……你怎么可以？

20:00.275 --> 20:01.689
[ snarling]
[咆哮]

20:01.793 --> 20:04.655
SpongeBob's been infected
by his own pet snail.
海绵宝宝被感染了
由他自己的宠物蜗牛。

20:04.758 --> 20:06.344
Oh, the irony.
哦，讽刺的是。

20:06.448 --> 20:08.586
Quick, we must quarantine
that infected snail
快点，我们必须隔离
那只被感染的蜗牛

20:08.689 --> 20:11.068
before he bites
every last Bikini Bottomite.
在他咬之前
每一个最后的比基尼Bottomite。

20:11.172 --> 20:12.448
Let's get that snail.
让我们把那只蜗牛抓起来吧。

20:12.551 --> 20:13.482
ALL:
Yeah!
全部：
是啊！

20:13.586 --> 20:15.862
[ angry shouting]
[愤怒的喊叫]

20:17.655 --> 20:19.241
No, don't hurt him.
不，别伤害他。

20:19.344 --> 20:21.103
Hand over the snail.
把蜗牛递过来。

20:22.344 --> 20:24.965
It's for his own good,
SpongeBob.
都是为了他好
海绵宝宝。

20:25.068 --> 20:27.724
No, I won't let you
touch Gary.
不，我不会让你
触摸加里。

20:27.827 --> 20:29.482
Stop the madness,
man.
停止疯狂，
男人。

20:29.586 --> 20:32.172
The mad snail disease
ends now.
疯狂的蜗牛病
现在结束。

20:32.275 --> 20:33.965
Seize the snail.
抓住蜗牛。

20:34.068 --> 20:34.965
Halt!
停止！

20:35.068 --> 20:38.793
Did someone say
mad snail disease?
有人说过吗
疯狂蜗牛病？

20:38.896 --> 20:41.551
Is that what all this fuss
is about?
这就是大惊小怪的原因吗
是关于？

20:41.655 --> 20:44.137
Yeah. What do you
know about it?
是的。你做什么
知道吗？

20:44.241 --> 20:45.586
Funny you should ask.
有趣的是你应该问。

20:45.689 --> 20:47.448
Allow me to introduce myself.
请允许我自我介绍一下。

20:47.551 --> 20:49.275
Dr. Gill Gilliam.
吉尔·吉列姆博士。

20:49.379 --> 20:51.724
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.
S.D.E. + S.E.

20:51.827 --> 20:53.724
"S.D.E. + S.E."?
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？
“S.D.E.+S.E.”？

20:53.827 --> 20:57.034
Snail disease expert
and snail expert.
蜗牛病专家
和蜗牛专家。

20:57.137 --> 20:59.241
I'm sorry to break
this to you all,
抱歉打破了
这给你们大家，

20:59.344 --> 21:02.758
but that "mad snail disease"
you're talking about
但那个“疯狂蜗牛病”
你说的是

21:02.862 --> 21:05.172
it doesn't exist.
它不存在。

21:05.275 --> 21:06.103
ALL:
Huh?
全部：
啊？

21:06.206 --> 21:08.275
That's right, no such thing.
没错，没有这样的事情。

21:08.379 --> 21:11.344
It's an old urban legend,
a myth.
这是一个古老的都市传说
一个神话。

21:11.448 --> 21:14.068
Well, does that mean
we're not zombies?
嗯，这是否意味着
我们不是僵尸？

21:14.172 --> 21:15.827
Of course not.
当然不是。

21:15.931 --> 21:16.965
No one is.
没有人是。

21:17.068 --> 21:18.620
It's just mass hysteria.
这只是集体歇斯底里。

21:18.724 --> 21:21.172
But what about my severely
untrimmed...?
但我的严重呢
未修剪的...？

21:21.275 --> 21:23.758
Those are only
moderately untrimmed.
这些只是
适度未修剪。

21:23.862 --> 21:27.103
All the supposed symptoms
are just common ailments.
所有假定的症状
都只是常见病。

21:27.206 --> 21:28.655
Easy, boy.
简单，男孩。

21:28.758 --> 21:30.344
But what about Gary then?
那么加里呢？

21:30.448 --> 21:32.068
If he doesn't have
a disease,
如果他没有
一种疾病，

21:32.172 --> 21:35.344
why'd he bite
all those people
including me?
他为什么咬
所有那些人
包括我？

21:36.827 --> 21:38.551
Hmm?
唔？

21:38.655 --> 21:40.551
Uh-huh, the problems
right here.
呵呵，问题来了
就在这里。

21:40.655 --> 21:42.551
He's got
a little splinter
他有
一点碎片

21:42.655 --> 21:44.137
in his foot.
在他的脚下。

21:50.103 --> 21:53.413
I'm sure this was causing
him distemper.
我确信这是造成的
他得了瘟疫。

21:53.517 --> 21:56.551
Making for serious
grouchy snailitis.
认真做事
脾气暴躁的蜗牛炎。

21:56.655 --> 22:00.689
Oh, Gary, I knew you weren't
disease-ridden.
哦，加里，我知道你不是
疾病缠身。

22:00.793 --> 22:02.172
Do you still love me?
你还爱我吗？

22:02.275 --> 22:03.103
Meow.
喵。

22:03.206 --> 22:04.551
[ laughing]
[笑]

22:04.655 --> 22:06.206
Good old Gary's back.
好样的老加里回来了。

22:06.310 --> 22:08.931
[ moaning]
[呻吟]

22:12.793 --> 22:16.034
Hey, Squidward,
you're not a zombie, remember?
嘿，章鱼哥，
你不是僵尸，记得吗？

22:16.137 --> 22:19.172
Oh, yes, I am.
哦，是的，我是。

22:19.275 --> 22:21.275
Welcome to the Krusty Krab.
欢迎来到蟹堡王。

22:21.379 --> 22:23.034
May I take your order?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

22:23.137 --> 22:24.482
All's well that ends well.
一切都好，结局好。

22:24.586 --> 22:26.068
[ loud snap]
[响亮的响声]

